<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.AFRICA'S JSE WARNING ON TOCO AUDIT.</title>
<headline>S.AFRICA'S JSE WARNING ON TOCO AUDIT.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Johannesburg Stock Exchange said on Monday it had been informed that audit opinion on the annual statements of industrial firm Toco Holdings Ltd would be qualified or disclaimed.</p>
<p>The exchange said in a notice to shareholders it would take action in terms of its listing requirements if the annual financial statements were disclaimed.</p>
<p>In a separate notice, Toco said it was in talks which might affect the price of its shares.</p>
<p>It urged shareholders to exercise caution in their share deals, but gave no further details.</p>
<p>--Johannesburg -27-11-482.1003</p>
</text>
